00:12:34,510 --> 00:12:38,070
when a scum sucker like that[br]can get away with sandbagging[br]a Doctor of Journalism ?

230
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:41,250
- Hey ![br]- Thanks for the ride !

231
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:43,750
- Don't worry about me ![br][ Giggling ][br]- Wait a minute !

232
00:12:43,820 --> 00:12:45,760
Come back[br]and have a beer !

233
00:12:45,820 --> 00:12:47,760
Shit.

234
00:12:47,830 --> 00:12:50,090
Fuck. I'm gonna miss him.

235
00:12:50,160 --> 00:12:52,600
- Move over ![br]- Did you see his eyes ?

236
00:12:52,660 --> 00:12:55,600
We have to get out of California[br]before that kid finds a cop.

237
00:12:55,670 --> 00:12:57,600
Scoot over,[br]you fat bastard.

238
00:12:57,670 --> 00:13:01,100
- We had a real freak on our hands ![br]- Oh, shit.

239
00:13:03,510 --> 00:13:06,840
