247
00:13:30,700 --> 00:13:33,030
You'd better be careful.

248
00:13:33,100 --> 00:13:36,940
Plenty of vultures out here that'll pick[br]your bones clean before morning.

249
00:13:37,010 --> 00:13:39,770
- You fucking whore.[br]- Hee hee hee.

250
00:13:41,050 --> 00:13:43,640
Here's your half[br]of the sunshine acid. Eat it.

251
00:13:43,710 --> 00:13:46,150
Yeah.

252
00:13:46,220 --> 00:13:48,150
Great.

253
00:13:48,220 --> 00:13:50,280
