256
00:13:57,360 --> 00:14:00,300
- [ Muttering ][br]- ~ [ Rock ]

257
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:02,230
~ Yeah, yeah ~

258
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:04,230
- ~ [ Continues ][br]- Are you ready for that ?

259
00:14:04,300 --> 00:14:07,240
Checking into a Vegas hotel[br]under a phony name...

260
00:14:07,300 --> 00:14:10,870
