263
00:14:16,610 --> 00:14:19,550
~ [ Continues ]

264
00:14:21,690 --> 00:14:23,280
~ Well, she's all[br]you'd ever want ~

265
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:25,020
~ She's the kind[br]I'd like to flaunt ~

266
00:14:25,090 --> 00:14:26,920
~ And take to dinner ~

267
00:14:26,990 --> 00:14:29,290
[ Man On P.A. ][br]Welcome to the Mint Hotel !

268
00:14:29,360 --> 00:14:31,260
~ Well, she always[br]knows her place ~

269
00:14:31,330 --> 00:14:33,200
~ She's got style[br]She's got grace ~

270
00:14:33,270 --> 00:14:35,830
