273
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:43,770
Hmm ? Mmm.

274
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:47,010
~ Talking about[br]my little lady ~

275
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:50,020
- Come on, take the ticket.[br]We're busy here.[br]- ~ And the lady is mine ~

276
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:52,180
Come on, take the ticket.[br]Take it.

277
00:14:52,250 --> 00:14:54,190
Take the ticket.

278
00:14:54,250 --> 00:14:57,750
- ~ [ Continues ][br]- I need this. Right ?

279
00:14:57,830 --> 00:14:59,660
I'll remember your face.

280
00:15:01,730 --> 00:15:05,100
[ Duke Narrating ] There is[br]no way of explaining the terror I felt.

281
00:15:06,830 --> 00:15:10,270
