282
00:15:10,340 --> 00:15:12,770
Will the owner[br]of a green Pinto...

283
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:15,970
Minnesota license plate[br]TG0432--

284
00:15:16,340 --> 00:15:18,970
[ Duke Narrating ][br]I was pouring sweat.

285
00:15:19,050 --> 00:15:21,340
My blood is too thick[br]for Nevada.

286
00:15:21,420 --> 00:15:24,350
