287
00:15:24,420 --> 00:15:26,350
[ Man Chattering ]

288
00:15:26,420 --> 00:15:29,390
[ Duke Narrating ][br]Okay. Be quiet, be calm.

289
00:15:29,460 --> 00:15:33,190
Name, rank[br]and press affiliation.

290
00:15:33,260 --> 00:15:35,190
Nothing else.

291
00:15:35,260 --> 00:15:38,200
...hamburger stand.[br]She was a waitress about 16 years old.

292
00:15:38,270 --> 00:15:41,360
