296
00:15:50,410 --> 00:15:52,310
Yeah.

297
00:15:52,380 --> 00:15:54,310
Pretend[br]it's not happening.

298
00:15:54,380 --> 00:15:56,320
[ Grunts ]

299
00:15:56,380 --> 00:15:59,150
[ Shouts ][br]Hi there ! Uhh--

300
00:15:59,220 --> 00:16:01,150
My name ?

301
00:16:01,220 --> 00:16:04,190
Uh... Raoul Duke !

302
00:16:04,260 --> 00:16:07,420
[ Muttering ] On the list.[br]Freelance. On the list, then ?

303
00:16:07,490 --> 00:16:10,090
Total coverage.[br]Uh-huh.

304
00:16:11,830 --> 00:16:14,770
I have my attorney...

305
00:16:16,970 --> 00:16:18,900
with me...

306
00:16:18,970 --> 00:16:21,910
and I realize that his name[br]is not on that list...

307
00:16:21,980 --> 00:16:23,910
but we must have[br]a suite !

308
00:16:25,010 --> 00:16:26,710
[ Muttering ][br]Must have that suite.

309
00:16:26,780 --> 00:16:28,710
What's the score here ?

310
00:16:28,780 --> 00:16:30,580
What's next ?

311
00:16:30,650 --> 00:16:32,780
Your suite isn't ready yet...

312
00:16:32,850 --> 00:16:35,850
