313
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:38,290
Aah ! No ! We haven't done[br]anything yet !

314
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:41,120
- I can handle this.[br]- [ Muttering ]

315
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:43,630
This man suffers[br]from a bad heart.

316
00:16:43,700 --> 00:16:47,060
