317
00:16:47,130 --> 00:16:49,570
Prepare our suite at once.[br]We'll be in the bar.

318
00:16:54,710 --> 00:16:57,640
Aaah ![br][ Grunts ]

319
00:17:03,320 --> 00:17:06,750
