323
00:17:15,830 --> 00:17:17,760
[ Woman ][br]I like the way you did that.

324
00:17:17,830 --> 00:17:19,770
Aaah ![br][ Whimpering ]

325
00:17:19,830 --> 00:17:21,770
Come on.[br]Come on. Come on.

326
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:24,770
- What's that ?[br]- Come on, come on.[br]Let's get some peanuts.

327
00:17:24,840 --> 00:17:27,770
