337
00:17:55,740 --> 00:17:58,170
Terrible things were happening[br]all around us.

338
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,670
[ Groans ]

339
00:17:59,740 --> 00:18:01,670
Buy us some golf shoes...

340
00:18:01,740 --> 00:18:05,540
otherwise we'll never[br]get out of this place alive.

341
00:18:05,610 --> 00:18:07,810
