342
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:09,820
No footing at all.

343
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:12,320
~ [ Continues ]

344
00:18:12,390 --> 00:18:16,320
[ Woman On P.A. ][br]Mr. Roger Pratt, please[br]call the hotel operator.

345
00:18:18,030 --> 00:18:23,220
~ How can I bear[br]to see your heart break ~

346
00:18:23,300 --> 00:18:25,630
~ To see your heart break ~

347
00:18:25,700 --> 00:18:29,000
~ Over me ~

348
00:18:29,070 --> 00:18:31,000
~ [ Continues ]

349
00:18:32,870 --> 00:18:35,810
[ Growling, Roaring ]

350
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:38,310
- ~ [ Continues ][br]- [ Growling, Roaring Continue ]

351
00:18:52,890 --> 00:18:57,190
I was right in the middle[br]of a fucking reptile zoo...

352
00:18:57,260 --> 00:19:00,320
