353
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:03,860
It won't be long now[br]before they tear us to shreds.

354
00:19:03,940 --> 00:19:06,200
[ Growling,[br]Roaring Continue ]

355
00:19:06,270 --> 00:19:09,000
- ~ [ Continues ][br]- [ Muttering Gibberish ]

356
00:19:11,350 --> 00:19:14,510
[ Muttering, Roaring Continues,[br]Volume Increasing ]

357
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:20,050
- Please ![br]- [ Muttering, Roaring Stop ]

358
00:19:20,120 --> 00:19:24,080
- Tell'em to get out[br]their fucking golf shoes ![br]- [ Growled Gasps ]

359
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:27,090
Jesus God Almighty,[br]look at that bunch over there, man.

360
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:29,090
