365
00:19:39,370 --> 00:19:41,310
- Hmm ?[br]- Are you ready ?

366
00:19:42,510 --> 00:19:44,880
- Come on, hurry up.[br]- Wait ! Don't leave me !

367
00:19:47,510 --> 00:19:49,310
[ Boy ][br]Two club sandwiches...

368
00:19:49,380 --> 00:19:52,840
and, uh,[br]two more club sandwiches...

369
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:56,820
one, two, three, four[br]shrimp cocktails...

370
00:19:56,890 --> 00:19:58,820
- Hmm ? Hmm ?[br]- and nine fresh grapefruit.

371
00:19:58,890 --> 00:20:01,260
- [ Rumbling ][br]- Vitamin C. Need all we can get.

372
00:20:01,330 --> 00:20:04,020
- Four chicken--[br]- There's a, uh...

373
00:20:04,100 --> 00:20:06,530
big machine in the sky,[br]some kind of...

374
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:09,930
- Quart of rum.[br]- well, electric snake[br]coming straight at us.

375
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:11,440
[ Gonzo ][br]Shoot it.

376
00:20:11,510 --> 00:20:14,500
Not yet. I want[br]to study its habits.

377
00:20:14,570 --> 00:20:18,240
- [ Boy ] You motorcycle people[br]sure are hearty eaters.[br]- [ TV: Rumbling, Explosions ]

378
00:20:18,310 --> 00:20:21,250
I need the cart.[br]I need to return with the cart.

379
00:20:21,320 --> 00:20:25,050
Thank you, but the cart needs to[br]go back with-- I'll be back !

380
00:20:25,120 --> 00:20:27,110
- You bastard.[br]- I've been hit, man !

381
00:20:27,190 --> 00:20:31,020
I leave you alone for 3 minutes[br]and you start waving that[br]goddamn marlin spike around...

382
00:20:31,090 --> 00:20:33,030
yelling about reptiles.

383
00:20:33,090 --> 00:20:36,290
