396
00:21:16,700 --> 00:21:18,640
- Duke ?[br]- Mm-mmm.

397
00:21:18,710 --> 00:21:20,640
Back there.

398
00:21:20,710 --> 00:21:23,800
- [ TV ] It looks as though[br]the North Vietnamese may--[br]- Duke ? Duke ?

399
00:21:23,880 --> 00:21:25,810
Hi ![br][ Laughs ]

400
00:21:25,880 --> 00:21:28,400
Lacerda.[br]Your photographer.

401
00:21:28,480 --> 00:21:30,420
You're not Portuguese, man !

402
00:21:30,480 --> 00:21:33,320
Hey, too bad you guys[br]missed the bikes checkin' in.

403
00:21:33,390 --> 00:21:35,320
