404
00:21:35,390 --> 00:21:38,290
- Husquavarnas, Yamahas, DMZs.[br]- [ TV: Machine Guns Firing,[br]Volume Increasing ]

405
00:21:39,830 --> 00:21:41,850
Kawasakis !

406
00:21:41,930 --> 00:21:44,660
