409
00:21:49,900 --> 00:21:52,340
All very, very fast.

410
00:21:52,410 --> 00:21:54,340
Very.[br][ Chuckling ]

411
00:21:54,410 --> 00:21:56,710
What a race[br]it's gonna be.

412
00:21:59,780 --> 00:22:03,220
