415
00:22:12,310 --> 00:22:14,240
Hmm ?

416
00:22:17,610 --> 00:22:20,550
[ TV Continues: Explosions,[br]Helicopter Blades Whirring ]

417
00:22:23,550 --> 00:22:25,710
I'm gonna tell you--

418
00:22:25,790 --> 00:22:29,420
