421
00:22:34,500 --> 00:22:36,430
[ Muttering ]

422
00:22:36,500 --> 00:22:39,230
Turn this shit off.

423
00:22:44,740 --> 00:22:47,230
The racers were ready[br]at dawn.

424
00:22:47,310 --> 00:22:49,240
Very tense.

425
00:22:49,310 --> 00:22:52,840
In some circles the Mint 400[br]is a far, far better thing...

426
00:22:52,910 --> 00:22:55,910
than the Super Bowl,[br]the Kentucky Derby...

427
00:22:55,980 --> 00:22:58,920
