430
00:23:03,430 --> 00:23:05,450
- [ Mutters ] Fuck off.[br]- All right.

431
00:23:05,530 --> 00:23:08,960
It was time to get grounded,[br]to ponder this rotten assignment...

432
00:23:09,030 --> 00:23:11,460
