433
00:23:11,530 --> 00:23:13,470
It was time[br]to do the job.

434
00:23:13,540 --> 00:23:17,470
Those of us who had been[br]up all night were in no mood[br]for coffee and doughnuts.

435
00:23:17,540 --> 00:23:19,870
