436
00:23:19,940 --> 00:23:21,880
- We were, after all...[br]- [ Gunshots ]

437
00:23:21,940 --> 00:23:24,000
the absolute cream[br]of the national sporting press.

438
00:23:24,080 --> 00:23:26,010
Pull !

439
00:23:26,080 --> 00:23:29,480
We were gathered in Las Vegas for[br]this very special moment in sport.

440
00:23:29,550 --> 00:23:32,490
- When it comes to a thing like[br]this, they don't fool around.[br]- [ Gunshots Continue ]

441
00:23:32,550 --> 00:23:34,990
[ Snoring ]

442
00:23:35,060 --> 00:23:37,990
- It's, uh, just beautiful.[br]- [ Chuckling ]

443
00:23:41,430 --> 00:23:43,860
