445
00:23:47,400 --> 00:23:50,740
- Crazy shit.[br]- A proper end to the '60s.

446
00:23:50,810 --> 00:23:53,740
Ali beaten[br]by a human hamburger.

447
00:23:53,810 --> 00:23:56,640
