00:24:00,720 --> 00:24:05,150
welcome to the start of the[br]$50,000 Mint 400 Desert Race...

451
00:24:05,220 --> 00:24:08,520
with a purse of $50,000[br]going to the winner...

452
00:24:08,590 --> 00:24:11,120
of this grueling, gut-wrenching,[br]dust-eating...

453
00:24:11,190 --> 00:24:14,250
in-your-face[br]motocross extravaganza !

454
00:24:14,330 --> 00:24:16,260
And there they go !

455
00:24:16,330 --> 00:24:18,270
We've got[br]rooster tails goin' !

456
00:24:18,330 --> 00:24:21,230
We're here to spit[br]in your enemy's eye !

457
00:24:21,300 --> 00:24:23,530
There they go.[br][ Mutters ]

458
00:24:23,610 --> 00:24:27,200
[ Man On P.A. ][br]All right, our second group[br]of ten is getting in place.

459
00:24:27,280 --> 00:24:30,570
- Kawasakis, Triumphs, Maicos.[br]- [ Engines Revving ]

460
00:24:30,650 --> 00:24:33,940
We're ready to go. It's the green flag,[br]and they're off !

461
00:24:34,020 --> 00:24:37,250
Another great start with a lot of dirt[br]happening on this hill !

462
00:24:37,320 --> 00:24:41,120
